# Accepted trivy findings, one ID per line. Each entry carries, on the lines
# above it: the module, why the finding does not apply or is accepted, who
# accepted it, and the date to revisit. An entry without a reason is a finding.
#
# Example:
#   # modules/bastion-isolated: no egress by design is enforced by the caller's
#   # network firewall, not this SG. Accepted by platform 2026-10-28, revisit 2027-04-28.
#   AVD-AWS-0104
